<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Lord, You promised Your return.</l><l>Make us lovers who are pure.</l><l>Keep our heart for You;</l><l>We would pursue You</l><l>Together.</l><l>Our Beloved,</l><l>Come soon.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Lord, You promised Your return.</l><l>Make us those who match Your heart.</l><l>Capture every part</l><l>Until we only live</l><l>For Your coming.</l><l>Precious Bridegroom,</l><l>Come soon.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
